cket) for critical situations later. The landlord has fewer cards (11) than my teammate (15), so I need to maintain pressure and control. Using an Ace here is optimal - it\'s strong enough to win this trick but not so valuable that I\'m wasting resources. Keeping the rocket gives me a guaranteed way to take control when needed most.\n\nAnswer: {"cards": ["♠A"]}'}
